      "caption_extra": "[Context, added by the transcriber: the section heading 'Average Costs of Transport' and the lead-in 'The following table indicates the costs of transport in the Shanghai district per ton-mile:' are printed at the foot of p. 500 (image p0523); the table itself is on p. 501.] (U. S. currency)",
